   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Agreement of the modal verb",
     "texto": [
      "**With a singular subject**: «Si può consultare il registro» (the register can be consulted); «Si deve compilare la richiesta» (the request must be filled in).",
      "**With a plural subject**: «Si possono consultare i dati» (the data can be consulted); «Si devono compilare i moduli» (the forms must be filled in)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Two possible forms",
     "texto": [
      "In formal language it is equally correct to say «I dati si possono consultare» or «I dati possono essere consultati», with the classic periphrastic passive. The advanced B2 student must master the immediate plural agreement of the modal verb."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
